{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06311","headline":"扈从御宿池 · 祖咏","name":"扈从御宿池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王既巡狩，辇道入秦京。\n远树低枪垒，孤峯入幔城。\n寒疎清禁漏，夜警羽林兵。\n谁念迷方客，长怀魏阙情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}